
  <sn><md>#### **Q. Define drainage. Discuss several drainage classes.**

**Ans:** Drainage refers to the `rapidity and extent of removal of water` from the soil. This removal primarily depends on-

* Surface runoff
* Internal movement through the soil and
* To some extent evaporation and transpiration loss.
</md></sn>
